I left out the enrichment fetch. This node's `with` clause grants only `aap:caps/state-read`, so it has no `http-client` import and cannot make that request. The request would also send untrusted feed text into a URL query, so it would leak data outside the node's authority. Adding the import would widen the node's authority beyond what its declared `with` clause grants, so it needs an explicit grant before it can be added.

